# S10-B gate pins (sourced by s10b-gate-d3a9.sh). Every value is a literal; the driver refuses on any malformed or
# unfilled value it needs. Update THIS file (and re-hash) if reviews change an owned file; the driver stays fixed.
# Fill help: `bash s10b-gate-d3a9.sh --fill-help <S10-A landing sha>` (read-only; prints the values below) or README.md.
# ---- base = the S10-A landing commit: exactly ONE commit on S10A_PARENT (e6f20300, the S9-C landing merge) adding the 14
#      FREEZE paths. Unknown at authoring.
BASE=92b9671511279254a8545c4cb531bf965762c597                       # git -C <landing clone> rev-parse HEAD after land-s10a.sh (40-hex)
BASE_TREE=b6fbbfd2a6495183433657814193b080c9582ab7             # git rev-parse "$BASE^{tree}"
MIGRATIONS_TREE=654550cb99b55473429a9c60ee08319e1b649106 # git rev-parse "$BASE:prisma/migrations" (S10-A touches no prisma -> expected 654550cb99b55473429a9c60ee08319e1b649106)
S10A_PARENT=e6f20300b495fa9eee9539ae58d30e3b60e5a78c   # BASE^ must be this (S9-C landing merge = integration/importer tip after PR #547 fast-forwards)
HARNESS_BASE_HEAD=a4af8e330bd4d6f882f0aebd411200b76d651aba   # kept: BASE_HEAD literal in test/utils/g2-s10b-{bootstrap.sh,db.ts}; the gate requires it to be an ANCESTOR of S10A_PARENT and BASE (git merge-base --is-ancestor; review B2 option a). a4af8e33..e6f20300 touches no prisma, so the harness prisma diff is still exactly the S10-B three
BRANCH=exec-d3a9/s10b
# ---- S10-A freeze (the 14 paths BASE adds over S10A_PARENT, "POST <sha256> <path>"). Read from this file; its sha is pinned.
S10A_FREEZE=/home/user/workspace/tgp-private-evidence/execution/d3a9f701/s10a/land/FREEZE.sha256
S10A_FREEZE_SHA=d54aee78dcc35910200a3c8db93ecff7305a95d1c34a65985e998ad1c71c398a
S10A_FREEZE_COUNT=14
# ---- owned S10-B paths: "<sha256> <mode> <state> <path>", M = tracked+modified (` M`), N = new untracked (`??`).
# 16 paths = 1 M + 15 N. Bytes = d3a9f701/s10b/devloop-2/POSTFORMAT.sha256 (after the pinned prettier 3.9.9 reflow and the two
# devloop test fixes; modes and bytes re-measured read-only in worktrees/d3a9-s10b 2026-09-26). The gate's prettier pass is
# expected to be a no-op on these bytes but is still run and recorded (preformat/ + postformat/ copies, POSTFORMAT lines);
# prisma/schema.prisma (no prettier parser in the hook globs), migrations/** (.prettierignore) and the .sh are never reflowed.
OWNED_PINS='d6d01f546f6c7988d93bdd60588e421bf6ff0a56b312f85eee962e0a6be0eb96 644 M prisma/schema.prisma
345f12de9037d77c12f69abd96286411edfbaae1fb9df3767b1907fbada7aa15 644 N prisma/migrations/20270124000000_scout_run_observation_expand/migration.sql
